    {
      "game": "Crime Boss: Rockay City",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/13333/450x258/crime-boss-rockay-city-pc-game-steam-europe-and-us-and-canada-cover.jpg?v=1787212800",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/13333-buy-crime-boss-rockay-city-pc-game-steam-europe-and-us-and-canada/",
      "user": "gamer-7cc9895",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "JUST THE BEST GAME OF BRACAGE EVER I PLAYED, this game show differetns tools,characters, many option to have fun and agreable session, the campain is so good but really good you can dominate all the gang and have fun in same time, that's a very good game i recomended"
